00:06:54.430 --> 00:06:58.629
Another deleted scene revealed in behind-the-scenes
footage shows Laurie coming to speak with

00:06:58.629 --> 00:07:01.740
her daughter Karen at Haddonfield Harmony
Community Center.

00:07:01.740 --> 00:07:06.550
It looks like this was probably an additional
scene to illuminate a little more about Karen's

00:07:06.550 --> 00:07:08.280
character and maybe where she works.

